  ],
  "texto": "This will hurt. Because it's about you. You know it's destroying you. And still, you can't stop. This isn't love. It's addiction. Literally. Your brain doesn't lie. The same region that lights up... ...in an addict waiting for their next hit. Same circuit. Same hijack. You're hooked — and you don't even know it. And the worse they treated you... ...the stronger the pull. Not despite the pain. Because of it. It's called trauma bonding. That's why you forgive the unforgivable. That's why you check their profile at 3 AM. Again. And again.",
  "voz": "en-US-GuyNeural"
